OL,12,     Fbanquet menus. (Ep4/4)
OL,13,G2205 The Firm
OL,14,     FA Harvard Law School graduate is
OL,15,     Fgiven a job offer that appears too
OL,16,     Fgood to be true, and once he
OL,17,     Faccepts, he learns that the
OL,18,     Fcompany perks were meant to buy
OL,19,     Fhis silence. Stars Tom Cruise.
OL,20,     F(1993)
